<speak>That is useful background for the way we arrange our service around you. We can make the routine contact less fragmented and avoid treating every administrative item as a separate telephone conversation. Turning to the review itself, I recommend reducing your holding in Atlas <sub alias="you ess dee">USD</sub> Corporate Bond 2031 because that reduces your exposure to the issuer and releases cash for your anticipated commitments, which fits your preference for liquidity rather than keeping the future coupon income. I will keep the remaining formal points together, so they do not become mixed up with your travel plans or office arrangements. Then, if you wish to take a breather from the main discussion, we can spend a little time on those everyday matters. There is enough time in the diary for both, and I am quite happy to follow a measured pace.</speak>